# Build output.
#
# site/ IS committed: GitHub publishes that folder exactly as it stands, one
# sub-folder per released day. Everything else here is rebuilt on demand.
# the whole booklet, your working preview — not published
_book/
_freeze/
_book-instructor/
.quarto/
# where `make release` builds a day before copying it to site/
dist/

# generated worksheets — rebuild with `make worksheets DAY=n`
print/

# machine-specific: written by scripts/setup_local.R, holds a local path
.Renviron

# misc
.Rhistory
.Rdata
.RData
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.Rproj.user/
Rplots.pdf

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
